OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum fees partly axed after drop
OL,4,Ain footfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial admission fees for a city
OL,7,Fcentre museum have been partially
OL,8,Fabandoned after a reportedly sharp
OL,9,Fdecline in footfall.
OL,11,FOxford City Council introduced entrance
OL,12,Ffees at the Museum of Oxford in January
OL,13,Ffor the first time since it opened in
OL,14,F1975, to fill what it said was a gap in
OL,15,Fits budget.
OL,17,FSince the #4 entry fee was introduced,
OL,18,Fcampaign group Save Our Museum said
OL,19,Ffootfall at the St Aldates attraction
OL,20,Fhad fallen by 70 ` 80% compared with
OL,21,F2024/25.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
